      "description": "Event Information After the sold-out anniversary world tour, one of the most beloved voices of our time – Valery Meladze – returns to the US in 2027. On May 16, 2027, San Francisco will experience an unforgettable evening as Valery Meladze takes The Warfield stage. Audiences can expect deep emotions, meaningful lyrics, and iconic melodies – featuring the timeless hits loved by millions. Above all, it’s the exceptional atmosphere that makes every concert truly special – once you’ve experienced it, you can’t stop talking about it. Valery Meladze’s music bridges generations, and his songs are recognized from the very first note. Each performance is deeply personal and emotionally charged, as he gives his all on stage – delivering passion, energy, and an unforgettable connection with every audience. San Francisco, May 16, 2027 – save the date for the incredible memories!The show will be performed in Russian language"
